### === BOOKS ===

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Get book by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/8

### Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Book",
  "authorId": 1,
  "genreId": 1
}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "authorId": 1,
  "genreId": 2
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### === AUTHORS ===

### Get all authors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/authors

### Get author by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/authors/1

### Create author
POST http://localhost:8080/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Author"
}

### Update author
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/authors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Author"
}

### Delete author
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/authors/1

### === GENRES ===

### Get all genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres

### Get genre by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres/1

### Create genre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Genre"
}

### Update genre
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/genres/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Genre"
}

### Delete genre
