### === COMMENTS ===

### Get comments for book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/comments

### Get comment by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1

### Create comment for book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great book!"
}

### Update comment
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated comment"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1

### === ACTUATOR ===

### Actuator index
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator

### Health with details
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Custom Library health indicator
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/library

### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics

### Logfile
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/logfile

### Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info

### === SPRING DATA REST (HATEOAS) ===

### Books via Spring Data REST
GET http://localhost:8080/datarest/books

### Authors via Spring Data REST
GET http://localhost:8080/datarest/authors

### Genres via Spring Data REST
GET http://localhost:8080/datarest/genres

### Comments via Spring Data REST
GET http://localhost:8080/datarest/comments
